					Less noise.<br/>
					<span class="text-gradient">More signal.</span>
				</h1>
				
				<p class="hero-desc reveal delay-2">
					OMNI is a smart terminal interceptor that filters out useless command output before it reaches your AI agent. Cut token consumption by <strong>up to 90%</strong> and give your AI the pure context it needs to reason brilliantly.
				</p>

				<div class="hero-cta reveal delay-3">
					<div class="terminal-install">
						<span class="prompt">$</span>
						<code>brew install fajarhide/tap/omni</code>
						<button class="copy-btn" data-copy="brew install fajarhide/tap/omni"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"/></svg></button>
					</div>
