						<h3>The Problem: Noise & Cost</h3>
						<p>When autonomous AI agents read your terminal, they read *everything*. A simple <code>npm install</code> dumps ~15,000 tokens of useless junk into your AI's context.</p>
						<ul class="bullet-list">
							<li><strong>Extremely Expensive:</strong> You pay real money for every single token of junk output.</li>
							<li><strong>Diluted Reasoning:</strong> Critical errors get buried. The AI becomes "dumb" trying to sift through garbage.</li>
							<li><strong>Model Lock-in:</strong> You're forced to use the most expensive flagship models just to have a context window big enough.</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<!-- The Solution -->
