						<ul class="bullet-list">
							<li><strong>90% Token Reduction:</strong> Drastically cut your agentic API bills instantly.</li>
							<li><strong>Higher Quality Answers:</strong> With no distractions, even affordable models perform on-par with flagships.</li>
							<li><strong>Contextual Quality:</strong> The AI's response is better because its context window is laser-focused on the real problem.</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					
